  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native `ImportPreviewModal`
  resolves (table "ImportPreviewModal") lives here with its web `t(key, default)` English value. These
  entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept
  in a per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without editing the
  shared catalog.

  Group 1 is the exact set of keys extracted from the web source
  (features/dashboard/components/ImportPreviewModal.tsx, plus the shared `common.close` it composes).
  Group 2 is the validation copy the web `validateImport.ts` hook emits as raw strings — routed through
  this facade so the native code holds no English literal while keeping the web wording. Group 3 backs
  the native chrome (placeholders / VoiceOver / empty hints).
*/

